{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/626569ece841c944f5d10f562d2fd232.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/626569ece841c944f5d10f562d2fd232.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/626569ece841c944f5d10f562d2fd232.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cOMG!!!!! Who did this?!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Utter chaos. Everything\u2019s a disaster!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/317ff72d635ac6b351a7bc8cd5db8ba6.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/317ff72d635ac6b351a7bc8cd5db8ba6.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/317ff72d635ac6b351a7bc8cd5db8ba6.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As if being a nepotism hire wasn\u2019t bad enough\u2014you accidentally walk in on a senior changing, bump into your manager\u2019s butt,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>and now you\u2019ve messed up an important project, too?!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After losing your friends, your job, and your money chasing your fashion dreams,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>you can\u2019t afford to fail again!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Raise your reputation, nail every shoot, and survive this wild workplace!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/2a7099dc1f187ccb7f6168ed42a926b9.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/2a7099dc1f187ccb7f6168ed42a926b9.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/2a7099dc1f187ccb7f6168ed42a926b9.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cFrom an otaku\u2019s perspective, this outfit would totally blow up online!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One word from you and the mood begins to change.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Maybe success isn\u2019t that far off after all?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Earn affection, take the perfect photos, and collect beautiful shots!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whether you focus on career or romance, your choices decide your future.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now, it\u2019s time to begin your first day at Lazaworks! \ud83c\udfa5</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heroines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/0512eafc7d77189fc986d77b824482e8.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/0512eafc7d77189fc986d77b824482e8.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/0512eafc7d77189fc986d77b824482e8.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joo Ah-reum \u2014 Influencer / Sharp-Tongued Diva</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cI\u2019m the influencer Joo Ah-reum. Do I really have to do this?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stunning content creator with half a million followers and an ego to match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019ll drive you crazy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But behind her pride, there\u2019s a surprisingly pure heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/7682330c9c6b4fec023850fec82eeac4.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/7682330c9c6b4fec023850fec82eeac4.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/7682330c9c6b4fec023850fec82eeac4.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sung Jun-hee \u2014 Marketing Manager / Fierce Workaholic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cI don\u2019t fall for new hire. If I don\u2019t like someone, I fire them.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charismatic perfectionist known for her stellar work ethic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re assigned to photograph her \u2014 will you make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it she has a soft spot for men who get the job done\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/68033064c6401fbd38543735d8b1c53a.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/68033064c6401fbd38543735d8b1c53a.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/68033064c6401fbd38543735d8b1c53a.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mina Suzuki \u2014 Lookbook YouTuber / Sultry Model</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cJiwoo, you\u2019re like a K-drama lead! So cool!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top YouTuber who owns the camera with her charm and confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet and bubbly on set, but fierce when facing her rival, Ju Ahreum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One compliment from you, though\u2026 and she turns bright red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/1025eff6fb01692525d3e6d3c6260920.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/1025eff6fb01692525d3e6d3c6260920.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/1025eff6fb01692525d3e6d3c6260920.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kang Hye-won \u2014 Design Senior / Your First Love</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cJiwoo, you\u2019d fit perfectly on our team. Want to transfer?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your college senior and first love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes she appears in daring outfits, asking teasing questions\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could this be the spark that reignites your past feelings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/416307c21c9c0f65e3769b6fe3f109d5.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/416307c21c9c0f65e3769b6fe3f109d5.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/416307c21c9c0f65e3769b6fe3f109d5.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Park Ji-young \u2014 HR Intern / Adorable Vlogger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cOppa still treats me like a kid, but I\u2019m an adult now!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and approachable, but not afraid to flex her HR authority when she needs to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s your clingy yet clumsy best friend...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but can you really trust her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five women, each with their own unique charm, secrets, and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you fall for \u2014 or will your heart choose someone else entirely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Immersive First-Person Romance Simulation</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the entire story through Jiwoo Kim\u2019s eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact, choose, and navigate realistic workplace moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make shapes relationships, tension, and outcomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 FMV Lookbook Photography Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just watching \u2014 you\u2019re the photographer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play interactive mini-games to capture stunning shots of the heroines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your photos unlock bonus videos, CGs, and exclusive lookbook collections.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 Diverse Heroines, Dynamic Choices</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From seniors to influencers, every heroine reacts to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each has her own route, secrets, and personality \u2014</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >giving you multiple ways to fall in love (or get in trouble).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 Multiple Endings &amp; Collections</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather lookbooks, unlock bonus videos, and replay routes to uncover hidden endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made a mistake? Don\u2019t worry \u2014 try again and craft your own perfect story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re Storytaco, an interactive game development studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project marks our first collaboration with WHYNOT Media,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and we\u2019re beyond thrilled to bring you this brand-new FMV experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to your amazing support for our previous FMV series,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we were able to take storytelling and immersion to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, we\u2019ve focused on the detailed world of lookbook production \u2014 <br>a vivid and realistic workplace where your choices truly matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We poured our hearts into every scene to meet your expectations, imagination, and desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please continue to share your love and feedback \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we\u2019ll keep growing and creating the stories you want to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you, and enjoy your first day at Lazaworks! \ud83d\udcbc\u2728</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"My life is left with nothing but debt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4057050/aa4cd32e514ab88d3887e650fa3bc48e7a4aa045.jpg"},{"name":"I'll get hurt if I keep this up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4057050/81230a6be7f710cd12ddc2ec563c724e069d852a.jpg"},{"name":"A company where nothing works","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4057050/d724651c30015b8dbd8fb6f70958fcc325b19da2.jpg"},{"name":"Born to be a photographer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4057050/20cc5d22ebb4ac7918049813fbe08595acf11ff4.jpg"},{"name":"Kim Ji-woo the newbie at my dream company","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4057050/deb8ef4cc193f2f2efbdbd95aaaa9aaa6bdbcc6e.jpg"},{"name":"A man obsessed with fashion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4057050/ef759b72a1eac18f85f68fe8171ddca861c5d2a9.jpg"},{"name":"A ruthless competitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4057050/d5e82a77cc0cfa2d6d5f3cd825812db453426041.jpg"},{"name":"An honest person","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4057050/aa97fdfbdbbfda3a9b2b01bf325d0ec66cafbb16.jpg"},{"name":"Working out was never the goal from the start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4057050/44b7707e646531d3a02c653ff9e4f5f8fc61c174.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet romance with my boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4057050/c5b0c42cdaa89bbd2ca5d998f110a4820bcb94fe.jpg"}],"total":69},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057050?t=1768351682","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/5119953b59b90a8e998560cf0726d96adefc3065/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768351682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/28100af0465557ba2e7cc997a69e4266c5676934/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768351682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/28100af0465557ba2e7cc997a69e4266c5676934/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768351682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Game contains sensitive contents such as partial nudity or sexual content, as well as alcohol use, may not be suitable for all age ranges."},"demos":[{"appid":4130920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/626569ece841c944f5d10f562d2fd232.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/626569ece841c944f5d10f562d2fd232.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/626569ece841c944f5d10f562d2fd232.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cOMG!!!!! Who did this?!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Utter chaos. Everything\u2019s a disaster!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/317ff72d635ac6b351a7bc8cd5db8ba6.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/317ff72d635ac6b351a7bc8cd5db8ba6.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/317ff72d635ac6b351a7bc8cd5db8ba6.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As if being a nepotism hire wasn\u2019t bad enough\u2014you accidentally walk in on a senior changing, bump into your manager\u2019s butt,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>and now you\u2019ve messed up an important project, too?!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After losing your friends, your job, and your money chasing your fashion dreams,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>you can\u2019t afford to fail again!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Raise your reputation, nail every shoot, and survive this wild workplace!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/2a7099dc1f187ccb7f6168ed42a926b9.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/2a7099dc1f187ccb7f6168ed42a926b9.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/2a7099dc1f187ccb7f6168ed42a926b9.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cFrom an otaku\u2019s perspective, this outfit would totally blow up online!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One word from you and the mood begins to change.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Maybe success isn\u2019t that far off after all?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Earn affection, take the perfect photos, and collect beautiful shots!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whether you focus on career or romance, your choices decide your future.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now, it\u2019s time to begin your first day at Lazaworks! \ud83c\udfa5</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heroines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/0512eafc7d77189fc986d77b824482e8.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/0512eafc7d77189fc986d77b824482e8.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/0512eafc7d77189fc986d77b824482e8.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joo Ah-reum \u2014 Influencer / Sharp-Tongued Diva</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cI\u2019m the influencer Joo Ah-reum. Do I really have to do this?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stunning content creator with half a million followers and an ego to match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019ll drive you crazy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But behind her pride, there\u2019s a surprisingly pure heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/7682330c9c6b4fec023850fec82eeac4.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/7682330c9c6b4fec023850fec82eeac4.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/7682330c9c6b4fec023850fec82eeac4.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sung Jun-hee \u2014 Marketing Manager / Fierce Workaholic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cI don\u2019t fall for new hire. If I don\u2019t like someone, I fire them.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charismatic perfectionist known for her stellar work ethic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re assigned to photograph her \u2014 will you make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it she has a soft spot for men who get the job done\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/68033064c6401fbd38543735d8b1c53a.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/68033064c6401fbd38543735d8b1c53a.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/68033064c6401fbd38543735d8b1c53a.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mina Suzuki \u2014 Lookbook YouTuber / Sultry Model</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cJiwoo, you\u2019re like a K-drama lead! So cool!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top YouTuber who owns the camera with her charm and confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet and bubbly on set, but fierce when facing her rival, Ju Ahreum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One compliment from you, though\u2026 and she turns bright red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/1025eff6fb01692525d3e6d3c6260920.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/1025eff6fb01692525d3e6d3c6260920.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/1025eff6fb01692525d3e6d3c6260920.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kang Hye-won \u2014 Design Senior / Your First Love</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cJiwoo, you\u2019d fit perfectly on our team. Want to transfer?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your college senior and first love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes she appears in daring outfits, asking teasing questions\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could this be the spark that reignites your past feelings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/416307c21c9c0f65e3769b6fe3f109d5.poster.avif?t=1768351682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/416307c21c9c0f65e3769b6fe3f109d5.webm?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/416307c21c9c0f65e3769b6fe3f109d5.mp4?t=1768351682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Park Ji-young \u2014 HR Intern / Adorable Vlogger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cOppa still treats me like a kid, but I\u2019m an adult now!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and approachable, but not afraid to flex her HR authority when she needs to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s your clingy yet clumsy best friend...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but can you really trust her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five women, each with their own unique charm, secrets, and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you fall for \u2014 or will your heart choose someone else entirely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Immersive First-Person Romance Simulation</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the entire story through Jiwoo Kim\u2019s eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact, choose, and navigate realistic workplace moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make shapes relationships, tension, and outcomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 FMV Lookbook Photography Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just watching \u2014 you\u2019re the photographer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play interactive mini-games to capture stunning shots of the heroines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your photos unlock bonus videos, CGs, and exclusive lookbook collections.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 Diverse Heroines, Dynamic Choices</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From seniors to influencers, every heroine reacts to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each has her own route, secrets, and personality \u2014</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >giving you multiple ways to fall in love (or get in trouble).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 Multiple Endings &amp; Collections</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather lookbooks, unlock bonus videos, and replay routes to uncover hidden endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made a mistake? Don\u2019t worry \u2014 try again and craft your own perfect story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re Storytaco, an interactive game development studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project marks our first collaboration with WHYNOT Media,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and we\u2019re beyond thrilled to bring you this brand-new FMV experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to your amazing support for our previous FMV series,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we were able to take storytelling and immersion to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, we\u2019ve focused on the detailed world of lookbook production \u2014 <br>a vivid and realistic workplace where your choices truly matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We poured our hearts into every scene to meet your expectations, imagination, and desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please continue to share your love and feedback \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we\u2019ll keep growing and creating the stories you want to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you, and enjoy your first day at Lazaworks! \ud83d\udcbc\u2728</p>","developers":[" Storytaco"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/1b7418eef308fdf157f77c7c92dada8844da121f/header.jpg?t=1768351682","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057050/1428621850/3119419cc24a47a66d3f28c8f9f0d18b8502f9d3/1761620004/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761622575","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057050/1428621850/3119419cc24a47a66d3f28c8f9f0d18b8502f9d3/1761620004/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761622575","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.